      "message": "display_charge takes into account CONFIG_BATT_HOST_FULL_FACTOR, which is more-or-less the same as BATTERY_LEVEL_NEAR_FULL. So, this line should be:\n\n    if (charge_get_display_charge() \u003c 1000)\n\nI think we need to deprecate BATTERY_LEVEL_NEAR_FULL. It\u0027s not used elsewhere and causing confusion.\n\nFYI: display_charge is calculated at battery_compensate_params.",
